{"conclusion_raw":"To reassemble just follow steps 13 and 14.","conclusion_rendered":"<p>To reassemble just follow steps 13 and 14.</p>","difficulty":"Easy","documents":[],"flags":[{"title":"Featured Student Guide","flagid":"GUIDE_FEATURED_STUDENT","text":"This guide has been the hard work of our awesome students and is found to be exceptionally cool by the iFixit staff."}],"guideid":182595,"image":{"id":3565843,"guid":"QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss","mini":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.mini","thumbnail":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.thumbnail","140x105":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.140x105","200x150":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.200x150","standard":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.standard","440x330":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.440x330","medium":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.medium","large":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.large","huge":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.huge","original":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.full"},"introduction_raw":"This guide demonstrates how to safely and easily unclog your Bosch SHEM78WH5N/52 dishwasher. Excessive buildup of food, grease, or debris in the drain filter, outlet hose, or air gap can impair the dishwasher's drainage system.\n\nOne way to check for a clog is to look for a visual indicator on the dishwasher’s display. The error code ***E22*** signals that the drain filter is clogged.\n\n***Before you begin any maintenance***, make sure to remove any remaining dishes from the dishwasher.","introduction_rendered":"<p>This guide demonstrates how to safely and easily unclog your Bosch SHEM78WH5N/52 dishwasher. Excessive buildup of food, grease, or debris in the drain filter, outlet hose, or air gap can impair the dishwasher's drainage system.</p>\n\n<p>One way to check for a clog is to look for a visual indicator on the dishwasher’s display. The error code <strong>E22</strong> signals that the drain filter is clogged.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Before you begin any maintenance</strong>, make sure to remove any remaining dishes from the dishwasher.</p>","featured_document_embed_url":"","featured_document_thumbnail_url":"","locale":"en","parts":[],"prerequisites":[],"steps":[{"title":"","lines":[{"text_raw":"Open the dishwasher door.","bullet":"black","level":0,"lineid":null,"text_rendered":"Open the dishwasher door."},{"text_raw":"Pull the dish rack out and place it to the side.","bullet":"black","level":0,"lineid":null,"text_rendered":"Pull the dish rack out and place it to the side."}],"guideid":182595,"stepid":389753,"orderby":1,"revisionid":3642271,"pending_patrol":{"gsr":null,"gst":null},"media":{"type":"image","data":[{"id":3565843,"guid":"QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss","mini":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.mini","thumbnail":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.thumbnail","140x105":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.140x105","200x150":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.200x150","standard":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.standard","440x330":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.440x330","medium":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.medium","large":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.large","huge":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.huge","original":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/QoWcLO1AKgIiYfss.full"},{"id":3565848,"guid":"ERUaafJtEZGSHEJy","mini":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/ERUaafJtEZGSHEJy.mini","thumbnail":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/ERUaafJtEZGSHEJy.thumbnail","140x105":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/ERUaafJtEZGSHEJy.140x105","200x150":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/ERUaafJtEZGSHEJy.200x150