hten, and left (counterclockwise) to loosen.","bullet":"icon_note","level":1,"lineid":null,"text_rendered":"Remember the phrase: “Righty tighty, lefty loosey”—turn right (clockwise) to tighten, and left (counterclockwise) to loosen."},{"text_raw":"Lift the drain screen and filter basket up to remove it and put it in a nearby sink.","bullet":"black","level":0,"lineid":null,"text_rendered":"Lift the drain screen and filter basket up to remove it and put it in a nearby sink."}],"guideid":182595,"stepid":389754,"orderby":2,"revisionid":3658530,"pending_patrol":{"gsr":null,"gst":null},"media":{"type":"image","data":[{"id":3662915,"guid":"rJAuPf3YRa6OySio","mini":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.mini","thumbnail":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.thumbnail","140x105":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.140x105","200x150":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.200x150","standard":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.standard","440x330":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.440x330","medium":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.medium","large":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.large","huge":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.huge","original":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/rJAuPf3YRa6OySio.full"},{"id":3565850,"guid":"xRQnREEhsnGqEFwR","mini":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/xRQnREEhsnGqEFwR.mini","thumbnail":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/xRQnREEhsnGqEFwR.thumbnail","140x105":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/xRQnREEhsnGqEFwR.140x105","200x150":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/xRQnREEhsnGqEFwR.200x150","standard":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/xRQnREEhsnGqEFwR.standard","440x330":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/xRQnREEhsnGqEFwR.440x330","medium":"https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/xRQnREEhsnGqEFwR.medium","large"